            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "text": "So I just did this big chat with perplexity, and Kortex has a button appearing on the perplexity page that says “NotebookLM”.  I click it and it adds the entire chat to either an existing notebook I choose, or a new notebook I create on the fly.  Now I don’t have to dig through perplexity to find my stuff.",
                "type": "text",
                "circle_ios_fallback_text": "So I just did this big chat with perplexity, and Kortex has a button appearing on the perplexity page that says “NotebookLM”.  I click it and it adds the entire chat to either an existing notebook I choose, or a new notebook I create on the fly.  Now I don’t have to dig through perplexity to find my stuff."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
